{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "過菩薩下，釋佛地籤第四云：以菩薩時留習潤生，故至菩提樹下但斷殘習。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "日本問云：餘三昧及諸處皆以見思為真諦所破，此\n中何為俗諦所破邪？法智答云：此中及以業及見思同入生死，俗諦正為真諦所破，成於真諦三昧矣。餘文以\n業同塵沙破則成俗諦三昧者，各有所以。何者？如前無垢等諸文中，及以散善破於惡業，散善則成假觀也。此\n中以定善破於散善，則成空觀也。故云背捨伏見思等。記主窮幽，故有此對。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輔行\n第二云：破見惑故離四惡趣，破思惑故離三界生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "日本問云：近代疑者云：別教初\n住界內，見惑得已斷盡，豈第六住見猶未盡，退作凡夫逆罪人耶？法智答曰：若常程別教，皆云初住斷見，更不\n起諸重過也。況見惑名數雖多，乃一位頓斷，思惑乃經諸位方盡，此常所譚別教分齊也。今記主見云：身子六\n住尚退，復起重罪。遂以義求，恐有教文見思俱斷，至六心時，思猶未盡，見亦餘殘，所以能牽惡道也。此是記主\n約義斟酌之辭，下可將現行別教難也。若據起信，唯云不退，乃尅就圓人辨之。若論示迹，亦須示其階位，約惑\n分齊，方有退義也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "末"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一一諦上皆有愛見，愛如熱，見如寒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通用生者，破一\n一惑，即得無量俗諦三昧，利物自在，名通用生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但云八信至第十信斷習盡者，習通皆外塵沙無明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下文又云：豈有塵沙在見思外？豈有無明在二觀後？三惑既即，三觀必融。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下文又云：通教進斷習氣，及色心無知，得道種智也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "末"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裕四六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法障者，界內塵沙也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云\n云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其第九禪，即從十地轉入妙覺，故云一切通別惑累，若正若習皆盡。自十地已還，悉有正習。論解華嚴，不開等\n覺，十地即等覺也。言通別惑累，正習皆盡者，通即四住，別即無明。通惑正使，圓七信盡，習氣至佛，同別習盡，以\n今家於小乘習氣分別四四十六門故。若別惑者，四十二品斷位如常習氣，但如淨名疏說。彼引地持離一切\n見清淨淨禪，故但明見習。若引優婆塞經十地斷愛習，十地即等覺，豈不入重玄耶？故知別惑斷正使、外使，入\n重玄斷於習氣，文甚分明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "索隱記第一云：通即見、思，別即塵沙、無明。\n通、別各有正智，通盡已。久望前總記云：昏盡耳門，別惑正習，云何分別？答：界外見、思既無異體，正使習氣，安得\n\n兩殊？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "支佛侵習為淺處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
